{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a01f2f8737314cc1",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -1550,
      "y": -550,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "5",
      "label": "1. Art Direction and References"
    },
    {
      "id": "8cb537ac2e294fa0",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Art/Visual Consistency.md",
      "x": -1500,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "61c5cf3b574d4b97",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🎨 Higgsfield\n\n● **Available subscription**\n\nConsistent turnarounds, expressions, clothing, item concepts, and presentation references.\n\nReference only — not final 3D.",
      "x": -1350,
      "y": -170,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "4468fb3899ce428c",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -900,
      "y": -700,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 1120,
      "color": "3",
      "label": "2. First-Pass Creation"
    },
    {
      "id": "3bac076ab4014b60",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🧍 Main characters\n\nApproved front, side, and back turnaround → custom production model.\n\nDistinctive hero characters should not depend on a single-image one-click conversion.",
      "x": -850,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4c3d72e7aac472f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🧊 Meshy\n\n🧪 **Pilot tool**\n\nImage-to-3D starting point for props, furniture, vehicles, and environment pieces.\n\nEvery result goes through Blender.",
      "x": -670,
      "y": -330,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "e0e94940d729410f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Character Creator + Headshot\n\n⏸ **Deferred option**\n\nHuman bases, faces, and higher-volume NPC creation if it suits the approved style.",
      "x": -660,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a29daf19a6164ecf",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🖥️ Local generation lab — later\n\nTRELLIS.2 or Hunyuan3D on our servers after GPU, quality, cost, and cleanup-time benchmarking.",
      "x": -850,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "8b53ae8cffac4a43",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -150,
      "y": -550,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "4",
      "label": "3. Production Source of Truth"
    },
    {
      "id": "d841de461e4e44c1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🛠️ Blender 4.5.5 LTS\n\n⭐ **Installed and pinned production tool**\n\nModeling, sculpting, retopology, UVs, materials, LODs, collision, optimization, rig review, and final export.\n\nAI output remains a first pass until approved here.",
      "x": 90,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e1499bfd9b144b6",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Development/3D Asset Pipeline.md",
      "x": -100,
      "y": -90,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b60a25c1ee1846db",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 550,
      "y": -550,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "2",
      "label": "4. Rigging"
    },
    {
      "id": "6d1c9c16c2dd473e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🦴 Rigify\n\n⭐ **Primary rig system**\n\nBundled with Blender. Provides controllable production rigs for main characters and animation.",
      "x": 770,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "576a7d688df24441",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🦴 AccuRIG\n\n● **Fast alternative**\n\nAutomatic humanoid rigging for imported or experimental meshes, prototypes, and faster NPC tests.",
      "x": 790,
      "y": -150,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "7dca9c06bad84bcd",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": -550,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "6",
      "label": "5. Engine Delivery"
    },
    {
      "id": "55e3462122bf4a9d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🎮 Selected game engine\n\n◇ **Pending engine decision**\n\nSkeleton mapping, animation retargeting, materials, lighting, collision, and performance validation.",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c464468911cd4c92",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ✅ Production-ready asset\n\nApproved style, clean topology, correct scale and naming, optimized textures and geometry, tested LODs/collision, and validated in gameplay.",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "6"
    },
